flowchart TB
  accTitle: C4 L2 - Monitoring and credential containers
  accDescr: Grafana reads current JSON from the API and historical metrics from Prometheus. API review verifies the selected Grafana session. An isolated renewer publishes hot Zendesk credentials and cannot operate business state.
  Operator["Enabled reviewer<br/>[Person]<br/>Allowlisted Grafana server administrator"]:::person
  subgraph Bridge["Support Bridge - monitoring and credential container view"]
    Grafana["Grafana with Infinity backend<br/>[Container: Grafana]<br/>Current linked-pair table, numeric history and review links"]:::container
    API["Operator API and browser review<br/>[Container: PHP HTTP process]<br/>Separate monitoring-read and operator/session authority"]:::container
    Prom["Prometheus<br/>[Container: Prometheus]<br/>Scrapes numeric observations and evaluates rules"]:::container
    Business[("Business state<br/>[Data-store container: live.sqlite]<br/>Current verified baseline and workflow evidence")]:::store
    Telemetry[("Diagnostic registry<br/>[Data-store container: metrics.sqlite]<br/>Persisted numeric counters and histograms")]:::store
    TSDB[("Prometheus history<br/>[Data-store container: TSDB]<br/>Numeric samples; seven-day default retention")]:::store
    Sessions[("Grafana state<br/>[Data-store container: Grafana SQLite/files]<br/>Accounts, sessions and retained application settings")]:::store
    Renewer["Zendesk token renewer<br/>[Container: isolated PHP process]<br/>Issues bounded grants; no business or operator mount"]:::container
    Issuer[("Issuer configuration<br/>[Data-store container: private files]<br/>Only renewer reads confidential client configuration")]:::store
    Tokens[("Vendor credential bundle<br/>[Data-store container: private files]<br/>Atomic Zendesk access bundle and startup GitHub token")]:::store
  end
  Zendesk["Zendesk OAuth<br/>[External software system]<br/>Issues ticket-scoped access tokens"]:::external

  Operator -->|"Signs in and views dashboard<br/>HTTP, loopback 1990"| Grafana
  Operator -->|"Chooses conflict sources and reviews exact state plans<br/>HTTP, loopback 1988"| API
  Grafana -->|"Protected current JSON via Infinity<br/>HTTP /monitoring/pairs; monitoring token"| API
  Grafana -->|"Queries numeric history<br/>HTTP / PromQL"| Prom
  API -->|"Verifies selected project session<br/>Fixed internal HTTP /api/user; cookie"| Grafana
  Grafana -->|"Persists accounts and sessions<br/>Filesystem / SQLite"| Sessions
  Prom -->|"Authenticated numeric scrape<br/>HTTP /metrics; monitoring token"| API
  Prom -->|"Retains samples<br/>Filesystem"| TSDB
  API -->|"Reads current evidence without vendors<br/>Read-only SQLite snapshot"| Business
  API -->|"Reads numeric diagnostics<br/>SQLite"| Telemetry
  Renewer -->|"Reads client identity and secret<br/>Read-only private file mount"| Issuer
  Renewer -->|"Requests four-hour ticket-only grant<br/>HTTPS OAuth"| Zendesk
  Renewer -->|"Publishes bundle and heartbeat<br/>Atomic files under credential lock"| Tokens
  API -->|"Reads managed Zendesk bundle per request<br/>Read-only private file mount"| Tokens

  Legend["Key: blue = application container; green cylinder = state store; grey = external system.<br/>Worker and explicit CLI also read vendor files, as in the workflow view.<br/>Token renewer also sees the unused GitHub token in the shared volume; no per-file isolation is claimed."]:::key

